  "notes": "Screens use the UI words (路线, 进度, 设置 and its sections as Settings writes them). Pronoun 我 is in the not-a-command list, so requests like 帮我打开路线 are not commands and the UI label 找我的极限 is typed as 找极限. Please check: 去 / 前往 as ways to open a screen, 慢一点 / 快一点 and their short forms, and the Part counter 第3部分 (the word 部分 is a filler so 第3部分 reads as 3). Bebop scales are left out on purpose: 比波普 contains 比 (than). Second reader: added 12 nearMissNone lines (progress, time clauses, conditionals, complaints, 在哪) and 2 nearMissYours (录下吉他的声音, 退出路线); notCommand gained 会, 先, 弹, 时候, 结束, 失败, 不出, 不到, 不上, 好难, 更好, 卡顿 and questions gained 在哪 (not bare 卡 or 难: they sit inside 声卡 and 更难的). Leftover-as-name is still possible for a statement with no such marker."
